  "summary": "apm uninstall re-anchored a still-needed local package that ships a skill another package also ships, but kept the old final writer: the re-anchor changes install order, so a following apm install --no-frozen flipped the skill's recorded owner (identical bytes) or rewrote its content (different bytes). The re-anchor now records the writer a fresh install would, and refuses before any write when that writer's bytes differ or no receipt proves them.",
